    "summary": "@example/tidy-router route parameters allow prototype pollution leading to authentication bypass",
    "description": "## Summary\n\nRoute parameters named `__proto__` are merged into the request context without filtering, which lets a caller set properties every later request inherits.\n\n## Details\n\nSetting `isAdmin` on the prototype makes every request pass the default authorization check.\n\n## Impact\n\nAn attacker who can reach the affected endpoint can exploit this without prior access.\n\n## Patches\n\nFixed in 4.2.3.",
